    "body": "Drive-by: Did we already discuss \"cloneable\" vs. \"clonable\" (no \"e\")? I guess `shadowRoot.clonable` shipped some time ago, so I'm codifying that in https://github.com/whatwg/whatwg.org/pull/433.\r\n\r\nSome interesting links I found:\r\n\r\n- https://lists.gnu.org/archive/html/bug-gnulib/2023-08/msg00188.html\r\n- https://github.com/rust-lang/rust/issues/11132\r\n- https://bugs.openjdk.org/browse/JDK-1234712",
